        "text": "The first acceptance workload is the real MCP `vector.bin`. The operator recalls"
      },
      {
        "path": "docs/internal/b10-07/README.md",
        "line": 140,
        "text": "Embedding intentionally adds payload bytes to the artifact. Report that cost"
      },
      {
        "path": "docs/internal/b10-07/README.md",
        "line": 159,
        "text": "| Base64 embedded strings | Reuses serialized transport, but representation expansion and decoding are material in a Native guest. Serializing input as base64 does not require keeping base64 in the final artifact | Build input only; decode before Native embedding |"
      },
      {
        "path": "docs/internal/b10-07/README.md",
        "line": 174,
        "text": "generated `vector.bin`, generic binary payloads, manifests, guest sources,"
      },
      {
        "path": "docs/internal/b10-07/README.md",
